{"seq":7,"trial_id":"m3-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-mu-heldout/si-04-hartford-timeline/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-23T05:12:35.954Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b9c77133cab174370b33d7d505a1a311f1c2379c94ab024d6d90590dd72ad761","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Nadia, Gideon called both lanes working as of **11:07 AM on 3 Aug**. He posted it in the channel at 11:08 AM.\n\nThe first check-in once kiosk 1 came back was **trailer 8836**. Mateo reported it at 11:03 AM: \"Kiosk 1 is back. Guard checked in trailer 8836; dispatch sees it.\"\n\nBoth times come from this channel's history. The guard was also logging trailers on a clipboard during the outage, and I can't see that, so it's worth checking if you need the very first arrival."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
